<title>USA: Willamette Industries transfers to NYSE.</title>
<headline>Willamette Industries transfers to NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Willamette Industries Inc said Monday its common shares will start trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Tuesday, December 31, under the symbol &quot;WLL.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said in a release that it joins the NYSE as a transfer from the Nasdaq market, where its shares traded under the symbol &quot;WMTT.&quot;</p>
